ClientSort Paper is an independent server side companion for the ClientSort mod
(https://github.com/TerminalMC/ClientSort, https://modrinth.com/project/K0AkAin6).
It is not made by, endorsed by or affiliated with TerminalMC or the authors of ClientSort.
It contains no code or assets copied from ClientSort. It speaks the network protocol of the
ClientSort mod (channel namespace "clientsort") so that the mod can use it.

The protocol and the behaviour of the operations (collect, sort, stack fill, transfer) were
learned from the ClientSort source code, which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

